  "selection": "For each candidate (ensemble, blend weight w), RMSE of the blended prediction on each held-out month versus the v17 development prediction (the incumbent's recipe on the same rows: all departures of the month). A candidate is eligible when it is not worse than v17 on ANY month (ratio <= 1.0), its mean ratio over the three months is at most 0.9995 (a 0.05% mean improvement, the v18_v2 rule, now set before any v20 learner is fitted), and every month's paired-day bootstrap interval of the RMSE difference to v17 lies below zero. Choose the eligible candidate with the lowest mean ratio to v17; otherwise select nothing. The ens_v18_bag_q_70 candidate reproduces the incumbent and is a check, not a candidate that can qualify. Ratios to v9 and per-airport tables are descriptive only.",
